- IAP: `IAP_PREMIUM_PRODUCT_ID`, `IAP_ANDROID_PACKAGE=com.quizverse.app`, `BILLING_VERIFY_MODE=stub|apple_google`; Apple (`APPLE_IAP_*`) / Google (`GOOGLE_PLAY_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON`) — empty → 503; `POST /entitlements/purchases/verify`

### Release checklist (before store launch)

1. Set `APP_LINK_ANDROID_SHA256_CERT_FINGERPRINTS` + `APP_LINK_IOS_APP_ID` (Team ID)
2. Point `quizverse.app` DNS at the API; set `SHARE_PUBLIC_BASE_URL=https://quizverse.app`
3. Create Play / App Store products matching `IAP_PREMIUM_PRODUCT_ID`
4. Fill Apple/Google verify secrets; set `BILLING_VERIFY_MODE=apple_google`
5. Only then consider `ENTITLEMENTS_ENFORCE_QUESTION_CAPS=true`
